<title>UK: Partco names Philip Wragg CEO.</title>
<headline>Partco names Philip Wragg CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive parts supplier Partco Group Plc said on Monday it had appointed Philip Wragg as chief executive.</p>
<p>Wragg, who will take up his post on July 1, succeeds Peter Redfern who will remain a director on the board until his retirement in April 1998, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
